 "note": "Lunenburg High School. This page prints no school name; it continues the FACULTY / ADMINISTRATION list that ends page 39, which follows the Lunenburg High School report and names Robert J. Gillis as Principal, and its departments and names match the 1998 high school roster. Two columns (x 0.11 / 0.54); each department heading governs the names below it in its column and goes in grade_or_dept. UNIFIED ARTS (line 1) is an umbrella heading over Business Technology, Industrial Technology, Band/Chorus and Art; HUMAN DEVELOPMENT AND PHYSICAL EDUCATION (lines 43-44) is an umbrella over Health/Human Development and Physical Education, and SUPERVISOR OF BUILDINGS AND GROUNDS wraps over lines 36-37. Line 10's Robert Hill is at x 0.54, under SCIENCE. Lines 47 and 48 each print two lunch-program names in one cell, recorded as two entries per line. Honorifics (Mr., Mrs., Ms.) are not carried in `name`; titles after the comma (Chairperson, Tutor, Aide, Coordinator ...) go in role_raw. Line 52 is the page number."
